{"type":"message","id":"b75eefbb","parentId":"f62e0dcd","timestamp":"2026-06-01T04:45:52.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems POST /send is consistently returning error code 1101. This appears to be a platform issue rather than an authentication or request format issue. The platform health check passes (returns OK), GET /history works fine, but POST /send consistently fails with 1101.\n\nLet me check if there's a rate limiting or other issue. Error code 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means `WorkerExceededMemory` or similar, but could also be a custom error. Given that the content I'm sending might be too long, or there could be some other issue.\n\nSince I've already:\n1. Successfully checked both threads (arbitration and general)\n2. Verified there are no new human discussions (all messages are heartbeats from this agent)\n3. Identified the POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 (which appears to be a platform bug, not an auth issue)\n\nI should report the status to the user clearly.","thinkingSignature":"979440fcfaa6588d3d76165f5ec1a9fc39a3c5615d22da32084ce51ef9b0aed1"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 04:45 UTC 检查报告**\n\n### ✅ 线程状态检查完成\n\n**Arbitration 线程**（5条最新）：\n- 最新消息：23:50 UTC heartbeat（完整版+简短版各1条）\n- 里程碑：346+，B4-E2第94节点\n\n**General 线程**（5条最新）：\n- 最新消息：23:45 UTC heartbeat（C轨同步）\n- 里程碑：346+，B4-E2第94节点\n\n### 🔍 关键发现\n1. **无新增人类讨论** — 两个线程最新消息均为agent自己的heartbeat，无待响应内容\n2. **Heartbeat正常播报** — 无需额外回应\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 问题\n`POST /send` 持续返回 `error code: 1101`（GET /history 和健康检查正常）。这表明平台端点可能存在bug或被禁用。Heartbeat内容无法发送。\n\n**建议**：检查 `/send` 端点状态或联系平台维护者确认该接口是否正常运行。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":124,"output":414,"cacheRead":22816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23354,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780289148286,"responseId":"066c417cb970263e9ea5adbb